AuronQ Universal Miner v0.4.6-alpha release trigger

Legacy NVIDIA compatibility update:
- packaged CUDA 12.6 legacy backend for supported Maxwell/Pascal/Volta targets
- GTX 10xx/Pascal can use native legacy CUDA when canonical AQM64 self-test passes
- Solo AUTO: primary CUDA -> legacy CUDA -> OpenCL GPU -> CPU
- Pool mode no longer rejects older NVIDIA GPUs using AuronQ native CUDA eligibility
- GUI shows actual AUTO fallback reason
- no Mainnet consensus changes
